00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.330
Oh! There might be!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.000
The truth is...

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.330
I've bought all the equipment needed to do "Sang_It."

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.330
Note: A subcategory on J-website Niconico

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.330
where people upload their own songs

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:25.000
I was in pretty high spirits,
or maybe it was just a whim,

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.580
but it was a pain to get working, so I gave up.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:33.000
Still, if this will convey my feelings to Teishotoku P-sama,
maybe I'll give it another shot!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:39.290
The song I uploaded the other day
was a rather good one, if I do say so myself.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:43.290
As usual, my numbers aren't
going up that much though...

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.880
Ah, yes.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.580
It was a clear afternoon like this,
when I wrote that song...

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:51.460
Welcome!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.080
Sorry. I didn't make an appointment...

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.250
Well, that's okay!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.880
Are you a first-timer?

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:01.630
Yes.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.420
This way, please.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.710
His "sense" as a hair stylist is somewhat broken.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.040
This will not turn out well...

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:09.960
Good. Okay!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:16.580
All I do is look ahead

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:21.960
and before long, I begin to walk unsteadily

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:27.130
In the past I would often get lost, but

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:26.130
Hang on a sec. I'm gonna go get
some random magazines.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:35.880
Now, in order to get lost, there are hardly any choices at all

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.830
Here you go.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.750
100 Middle-aged Ladies

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.750
Found in Town

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.750
Bimajo VS Bumajo

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.750
I think you'll like these.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.750
We Still Prefer Amateurs

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.130
So, how much would you like to cut off?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.500
About five centimeters on both ends, please.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.500
Five centimeters, huh?

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.670
That seems kinda half-hearted.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.750
Wouldn't you rather go all out
and cut about 20 centimeters?

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.080
That would just be a buzz cut!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.380
I feel more relaxed when it's longer, so...

00:04:54.210 --> 00:05:04.500
A haphazard me always just had excuses lined up

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.040
Well, that's okay.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:09.830
In the white moon that I see in broad daylight

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:18.080
I can no longer draw lines as clear colored as they were yesterday

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.750
It's strange.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.290
The lyrics are racing throughout my body...

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.540
My cat really is cute, you know.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.130
Okay, I'm going to raise the chair a little.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.210
Now I'm lowering it!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:42.130
The view from the top of the hill is beautiful

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.790
Okay!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:47.380
Just like as if it was a creation

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.460
Now it's wash time!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:52.790
The distinction between reality and ideal also becomes unclear

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:57.960
Dawn comes again

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.500
By the way, are you a cat fan?

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.040
Well, I wouldn't go that far...

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:03.670
Huh?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.040
So, do you like them? Or hate them?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:07.960
You like them?

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:11.500
Yes.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:16.670
In a world where only "yes" can be said

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.000
Which do you think is smarter, a dog or a cat?

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.880
You'd think it would be a dog,
because they can do a lot of tricks, right?

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:22.000
Will my voice reach you all the way?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:20.580
Nope! You'd be wrong. Sorry.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:27.330
In a world that's full of information

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.630
You know how cats don't listen to what you say?

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:27.330
That's because they can think and act on their own.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:36.130
My words will probably get twisted and unraveled

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.000
Well, if we're talking about Motchinyan,
I do rather like that.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.750
Wait, what? What's that?

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.330
It's a character. A cat.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.580
Oh, really?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:41.330
Yeah, easily

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.960
What a heartbreakingly tender song...

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.960
4:20...

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:57.330
Nothing's changed at all.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.250
Something like that happened, and then...

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.250
Yeah, it was a song I made on impulse.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:06.880
I tried singing "16:20" ver...

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:08.130
I tried singing "16:20" Ver. akane

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:08.130
I sang this for you.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:08.130
If you don't mind, please listen to it.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:09.920
"Tried singing" it?

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:12.380
Someone sang that for me?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.000
I tried singing 16:20 Ver. akane

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.000
I sang this for you.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.000
If you don't mind, please listen to it.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:13.880
Let's see.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.460
Th-this is...!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.380
I... I really uploaded it!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.790
Please let it reach him...

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.290
Oh, Teishotoku P!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.420
This is amazing...

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.380
Thinking back on it, I'm getting angry again.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.540
Hey, Kikuchi.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.290
What's with this notebook?

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.290
Mathematics

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.290
Akane Kikuchi

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.250
I thought I'd jazz it up a little!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.500
This sort of decoration hardly counts as quality...

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.670
Still, you're uncannily good.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:46.000
Well, of course!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.460
This one's future dream is to become a manga artist!

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.630
Hey! You...!

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.330
What are you talking about?!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.290
Oh. Kikuchi, have you already
decided on a career path?

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.880
C-career path?!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.000
Uh, I don't seriously think I could become one, so...

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.540
I'm telling you, you can!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:05.040
I think it'll be easier than humanity
deciphering the C-value paradox.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:05.790
It's not like that. Really!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.000
Dream...
It's not like that. Really!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:07.420
It's not like that. Really!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.830
A dream, huh?
Huh? Then what is it like?!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:09.880
Huh? Then what is it like?!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.380
It's finally here...

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.920
Since when, I wonder

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.920
Did your voice become a special sound?

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:18.630
A one-of-a-kind, original CD!

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.210
Still...

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.710
Though this was the smallest count, 200 CDs is a lot.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.830
I'll bring in 100 of them to the event venue,

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:29.920
and probably save the rest for mail orders.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.670
Vocaloid Meister...

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:36.170
A fan-manga exhibit and pop-up sales event
held several times a year.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:40.210
A number of Vocalo Ps that have
worked on famous songs also participate.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.170
A lot has happened for me to get to this point.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:47.000
But now, I've made these songs the way I wanted...

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
