00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
It's lovely

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
So nice

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
I'm here today again

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
Whoa!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
You sure make nice songs

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
Teishotoku P-san, all of your songs are wonderful

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.540
And there are people who say that they like them.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.960
I tried singing 16:20 Ver. akane

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.960
This is akane. This is the first time

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.960
I challenged myself to Sang_It.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.960
Teishotoku-P-san, I am a huge fan of yours.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.960
I will continue to always support you.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.960
Someone even sang one for me!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.380
I sang this for you.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.380
If you don't mind, please listen to it.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.130
I will be part of the event.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.130
My booth space is S-23b.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.630
Akane-san.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.630
Wow! For real?!

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.630
I'm definitely going!

00:08:56.630 --> 00:09:00.630
She's one of the few fans I have,
and she sang my song.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.290
And she's coming, is she?

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:04.460
Then we shall meet for the first time.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.130
Oh! You're so lucky, Robo!

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.130
Looks like Majo is reading your fortune!

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:11.880
Yes.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.880
If you like, I can take turns reading all of your fortunes.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:15.580
For real?!

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.420
So, Robo, what're you having her predict?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.630
The year is coming to an end soon, so-

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:20.920
It's about your fortune for next year?!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:24.630
I thought I'd have her tell me what fortune
I'll draw when I visit the temple for New Year's.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:27.290
Wait, can you get a fortune
about a fortune you'll be told?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.290
Here we go!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.790
I believe you'll draw the "Excellent Luck" fortune.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.420
Really?!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.460
I'm next!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.290
Okay.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:40.170
A warning has been given to not eat cold things,
to prevent getting an upset stomach.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.170
